# Stage 5 near layer (factor 13/16 ~ 0.8, y = 0): St. Wolfgang's houses
# climbing the slope behind the street - a meadow slope g with G
# hedgerows, a back tier of small gable-fronted houses with spruces and
# round trees G/j, and a front tier of big houses and two wide gabled
# inns: walls c/p/o (white walls are c: the near layer has no w,
# art-style 7) with o/E shaded right edges, wooden o gables with n
# boards, n balcony rails with p geranium dots, steep n/R roofs (left
# slope n, right slope R), T windows 2x3 and d gable openings 2x3.
# Opaque from its lowest roofline down (bottom 30 rows filled G).
# Drawn by the pixel-artist with a throwaway script; the grid is the source.
